@startuml SEQ_05_MENYETUJUI_GANTI_JADWAL
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-05: Menyetujui / Menolak Ganti Jadwal

actor       "Admin"                      as Admin
boundary    "Browser"                    as Browser
control     "GantiJadwalPiketController" as Controller
entity      "GantiJadwalPiket Model"     as Model
database    "ganti_jadwal_piket"         as DB

== Lihat Dashboard Permintaan ==

Admin   -> Browser     : Buka menu Kelola Ganti Jadwal
Browser -> Controller  : GET /piket/ganti-jadwal/admin
Controller -> Model    : Query semua permintaan ganti jadwal berdasarkan lab
Model -> DB            : SELECT ganti_jadwal_piket WHERE kepengurusan_lab_id = ?
DB      --> Model      : Data permintaan
Model --> Controller   : Data permintaan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman kelola ganti jadwal
Browser --> Admin      : Tampil daftar semua permintaan (pending/approved/rejected)

== Approve atau Reject Permintaan ==

Admin   -> Browser     : Klik "Setujui" atau "Tolak" + isi catatan (opsional)
Browser -> Controller  : POST /piket/ganti-jadwal/{id}/approve\n{action, catatan_admin?}
Controller -> Model    : Query permintaan ganti jadwal
Model -> DB            : SELECT ganti_jadwal_piket WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> Model      : Data permintaan
Model --> Controller   : Data permintaan
Controller -> Model    : update({status, approved_by, approved_at, catatan_admin})
Model -> DB            : UPDATE ganti_jadwal_piket SET status = ?, approved_by = ? WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> Model      : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Admin      : Update status baris di tabel

@enduml
